{"name": "Crown Of Silence", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1184\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/a680c7a6f4aa83bef6eb06644b55fde8.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"768\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/52df73c93f3ea7074f5f3b69edb0dddc.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Do not be bound by a single fighting style. Adapt your strategy on the fly with a vast array of weapons, armor, and magical artifacts found throughout your journey. Whether you prefer breaking enemy defenses with heavy strikes or dodging death with agile maneuvers, choosing the right equipment for the right enemy is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/0e049e4d9ed04db9cd183075ee78649c.poster.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"840\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/0e049e4d9ed04db9cd183075ee78649c.webm?t=1787308528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/ec45060412808867692e20cc77cde39a.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The guardians of the kingdom have not yet fallen. Face off against colossal bosses, each with unique attack patterns and weaknesses. Your reflexes alone won't be enough; your patience and strategy will be tested to their limits.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/cf57b5e69092778b12acaa686fbbb6e7.poster.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"840\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/cf57b5e69092778b12acaa686fbbb6e7.webm?t=1787308528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/cf57b5e69092778b12acaa686fbbb6e7.mp4?t=1787308528\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/d785754ea8a513dee930730a3158a80e.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  The narrative is embedded in the crumbled statues, the background details, and the world itself. Observe your surroundings closely; every ruin whispers a fragment of a past tragedy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/6f4fc0857fd9112d31e599b1049a1023.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> True to the classic Metroidvania spirit, explore a labyrinthine world of interconnected maps. Backtrack to previously inaccessible areas with newfound abilities, uncover secret passages, and lose yourself in the atmospheric beauty of this pixel-art Dark Fantasy world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/0b56296f62a6e09a09d88286736259a0.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every conversation, every item description, and every enemy encounter holds a clue to the history of this cursed land. It is up to you to piece together the fragments and uncover the secrets of the kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/f538226b71255c95af1341951a14de17.poster.avif?t=1787308528\" width=\"840\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/extras/f538226b71255c95af1341951a14de17.webm?t=1787308528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Crown Of Silence is a 2D Metroidvania adventure with Souls-like mechanics set in a gothic world. Forge your own combat style with diverse equipment, challenge ruthless bosses, and uncover the dark secrets of a silenced kingdom through environmental storytelling.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295320/7659789bf86e5d0b92e0d64425af27d0cc5457b8/header.jpg?t=1787308528", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Side Scroller", "Exploration", "2D Platformer", "Pixel Graphics", "Action"], "developers": "Nyro Interactive", "publishers": "Nyro Interactive", "release_date": "Aug 5, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "4295320", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/SyMlP-TlVSw", "first_seen": 1771459200.0, "review_rank": 1142}